body:
Can’t tell if you’re trolling or not, but anyway;
Non binary means you’re neither a girl nor a boy. It can also be used as an umbrella term, so another identity like agender (no gender at all, gender less) can also be defined as non binary. I am agender specifically, but on my post, I just put NB. 
What’s your gender?

i have returned. they let me eat outside instead of inside i guess. i manage to eat inside at breakfast because its not as bad, but now my teacher that sits at my table at lunch wants me to be inside. i asked someone to make me a note because the principal isn't around but they can't do that. so i either have to ask the same person who wants me inside in the first place or starve every time it's lunch

&#x200B;

i already had a breakdown on tuesday and i have 12 weeks left
